# Build context = repo root for every service image. Keep it small and never
# copy host-installed deps over the ones `npm install` puts in the image.
**/node_modules
.git
.github
**/dist
**/DerivedData
**/*.xcodeproj
apps/ios
apps/android
apps/web
packages/contracts/generated
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
scratch
reports
recordings
*.md
docs
infra
